    {"symbol": "🪜", "tooltip": "UBI and retraining cushion the fall but never ask who pushed the worker off the ledge."},
    {"symbol": "⏳", "tooltip": "The Engels Pause shows productivity can climb for fifty years while wages stay flat without worker power."}
  ],
