on-by-access answers a question no one asked — how do we run the model cheaply — while leaving the question that matters unanswered: who has the enforceable claim on what the model produces. Hand the worker a weights file and call it empowerment, and you have given them the burden and kept the surplus offshore. That is not distribution. That is the same managed underclass, now told they own the means of production they cannot operate.",
